pico-c64
========

This project combines code under several licences. All of them must be preserved.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Commodore 64/128 emulation core (cbm/core, except fastload.c and tape.c)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
From esp32cbm, Copyright (c) 2026 Robert Lucencic -
https://github.com/rlucencic/esp32cbm. MIT licence; the full text is in
cbm/LICENSE.esp32cbm. The changes made in this project are listed in
cbm/UPSTREAM.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6502 and Z80 CPU cores (cbm/m6502, cbm/z80) and cbm/port/emudbg.h
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
From esp32emu, Copyright (c) 2026 Robert Lucencic -
https://github.com/rlucencic/esp32emu. MIT licence; the full text is in
cbm/LICENSE.esp32emu.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Port glue, front end and build system (main.cpp, splash.cpp,
cbm/core/fastload.c, cbm/core/tape.c, cbm/port, hosttest, tools,
CMakeLists.txt, scripts)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 Frank Hoedemakers. Same terms as the rest of the emulator
family (pico-infonesPlus and others): the GNU General Public License,
version 3.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Submodules
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
pico_shared, pico_lib and tusb_xinput carry their own licences; see each
repository.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Commodore ROMs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Commodore 64, Commodore 128, 1541 and 1571 ROMs are not part of this
project and are not distributed with it. Users supply them on the SD card.
